"""Approximate recognizable markup and address triggers, not every lexical effect.

The main response is a quote opening a class attribute; other HTML fields
are weaker.  Web-domain pieces, image and video URL fields, JSON string
values, LaTeX array arguments, and named layout/input operations also respond.
